            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Moc - Thiso Mall Sala",
            "review_text": "Roving43623301291\n2 contributions\n0\nCom Tam Moc\nSep 2025 • Solo\nThe restaurant has a clean and comfortable space, making it easy to enjoy a casual meal. The staff were polite and quick to serve, which made the dining experience pleasant. The broken rice was fragrant and soft, and the grilled pork chop was juicy, flavorful, and well-marinated. Side dishes like pickles and soup were also nicely prepared, giving the meal a balanced taste. Prices were fair for the mall location, and the portions were generous. Overall, Cơm Tấm Mộc is a perfect spot if you are craving authentic Vietnamese broken rice with good service and a cozy atmosphere.\nRead more\nWritten October 3, 2025",
